croft-seq-analysis (0.2.0)

  * Fixed EMBOSS Needleman-Wunch algorithm's implementation for finding cleavage
    positions by removing the gap penalty at the ends of the target sequence.
  * Added background operator when combining cleavage positions.
  * Added cleavage ratio filter when combining cleavage positions.
  * Added cleavage distance filter when combining cleavage positions.
  * Added max edit distance filter when visualising cleavage positions.

croft-seq-analysis (0.1.0)

  * Initial release.
